BT 1 0 0 1 56 641 Tm /F4+0 10.2 Tf 12.24 TL (Fifteen modules. Each module maps directly to one chapter of Scrum Mastering I: Facilitating Improvement. These) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 56 627.5 Tm /F4+0 10.2 Tf 12.24 TL (objectives are used to demonstrate understanding for the Recognized Scrum Master 1 credential.) Tj T* ET
.113725 .141176 .129412 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 56 603 Tm /F2+0 11.6 Tf 13.92 TL (The domain of practice and a Practice Partner are part of the learning.) Tj T* ET
.113725 .141176 .129412 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 56 582 Tm /F4+0 9.6 Tf 11.52 TL (These objectives are not met by recognizing the language or repeating an accepted explanation. The book and the course) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 56 569.2 Tm /F4+0 9.6 Tf 11.52 TL (must be coupled with the learner's domain of practice, where actual conditions, constraints, and evidence give the) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 56 556.4 Tm /F4+0 9.6 Tf 11.52 TL (objectives meaning.) Tj T* ET
.113725 .141176 .129412 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 56 537.6 Tm /F4+0 9.6 Tf 11.52 TL (Every learner works with a Practice Partner: another learner, a practitioner within the learner's domain, or a 3Back Expert) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 56 524.8 Tm /F4+0 9.6 Tf 11.52 TL (Echo. For each significant objective, learners explain it in their own words, connect it to actual work, question one another's) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 56 512 Tm /F4+0 9.6 Tf 11.52 TL (accounts, test assumptions and competing explanations, and identify the evidence that would support or challenge their) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 56 499.2 Tm /F4+0 9.6 Tf 11.52 TL (conclusions.) Tj T* ET
.113725 .141176 .129412 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 56 480.4 Tm /F4+0 9.6 Tf 11.52 TL (The Practice Partner makes the learner's reasoning visible and correctable. The facilitator provides guidance and calibration,) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 56 467.6 Tm /F4+0 9.6 Tf 11.52 TL (but cannot supply the learner's domain experience or establish professional capability for them. Capability develops through) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 56 454.8 Tm /F4+0 9.6 Tf 11.52 TL (repeated judgment, action, and evidence in the work.) Tj T* ET
