.113725 .141176 .129412 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 56 222.5 Tm /F4+0 10 Tf 12 TL (2.1 Identify Team Member, Product Owner, and Scrum Master as the on-Team roles.) Tj T* ET
.113725 .141176 .129412 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 56 209.5 Tm /F4+0 10 Tf 12 TL (2.2 Distinguish Business Owner, Stakeholder, and Subject Matter Expert as outside-the-Team roles.) Tj T* ET
.113725 .141176 .129412 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 56 196.5 Tm /F4+0 10 Tf 12 TL (2.3 Explain why the Team must be self-contained and self-organized, yet not self-directed.) Tj T* ET
.113725 .141176 .129412 rg
